This software is provided for research and educational purposes only. It is
NOT investment advice. Nothing in this repository constitutes a
recommendation to buy or sell any security.

Trading in financial markets involves substantial risk of loss. Backtested
performance does not guarantee future results; most strategies underperform
their benchmark over time. Automated trading amplifies the impact of software
defects, misconfiguration and data errors, and can produce losses in a very
short period. Live trading through third-party channels (Tonghuashun /
easytrader, QMT, etc.) relies on unofficial interfaces that may fail, click
the wrong element, or submit duplicate orders.

You are solely responsible for any order placed by, or any loss arising from
the use of, this software. Use the paper-trading mode first. Only risk money
you can afford to lose.
